title: "Music-Detector-Backend"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-07-06"
url: "https://github.com/Henrycoding-design/Music-Detector-Backend"
abstract: >-
  A free and open-source music recognition backend built with Node.js and TypeScript
  that combines Chromaprint, AcoustID, MusicBrainz, and Shazam API into a unified,
  cost-effective pipeline.
keywords:
  - music-recognition
  - audio-fingerprinting
  - chromaprint
  - acoustid
  - musicbrainz
  - shazam-api
  - typescript
  - nodejs
